{"unit_id": "citydirector__deepinfra-fusion-proxy#card-zh", "repo": "citydirector/deepinfra-fusion-proxy", "commit": "8715a87f653f7dab79799f121b1dbb2b78666c3d", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "deepinfra-fusion-proxy 是 DSH Web 客户端的 DeepInfra 本地代理。DSH bundle 启动代理，并在输入区加入 Standard/Flex 控件和配置页面。代理按会话选择档位与等待策略，转换 DeepInfra 请求字段；Flex 遇到 429 时改用 Standard 重试，再按设置停留或冷却后恢复。其他 API 请求和流式响应也会转发。适合希望在 DSH 管理 DeepInfra 档位的用户；需配置 DeepInfra 路由与 API 密钥。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["server.js:159-169", "server.js:357-379", "plugin/deepinfra-proxy.mjs:285-300", "client/index.js:717-740"]}
